# Workers static-assets headers for the blastimage.com apex (blastimage-landing).
# Astro copies public/ into dist/, which wrangler.toml uploads as [assets].
# Policy: natabula docs/STACK-TENDENCIES.md §"Response security headers" (NAT-478); BI-077.
#
# - Content-Security-Policy is the full, enforced policy. The page has no
#   scripts. Its only inline content is Astro's inlined global <style>, so
#   'unsafe-inline' is style-only. The mark and favicon are inlined data: SVGs.
#   Revisit before adding any script, font, form or analytics (incl. Cloudflare
#   Web Analytics).
# - Strict-Transport-Security is host-only and short-lived while trialled
#   (300 -> 86400 -> 31536000, BI-081). Never add includeSubDomains or preload
#   without an owner decision.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=86400
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
